{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"更新遅れてすみません"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもコメントしてくださるかた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてのかた      ほんとーに有難う御座います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じかたが何回か同じblogにコメントしてくれて......とっても嬉しいです♪\nあっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また書いてくれてるー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思って..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってコメントしてる時間ってさぁちょっとはまあやの事考えてくれてるって事でしょ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それが嬉しくて嬉して........."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんでねぇ6月9日に！地元広島グリーンアリーナでイベントしましたぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさかあんなにもfamilyが来てくれるとは思っても見ませんでしたぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっという間だけど    わざわざ遊びに来てくれて                 ありがとー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さん&お父さん&おばぁちゃん&おじぃちゃんと友達が来てくれて......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃさらに嬉しかったよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はどうでしたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいでシャンプーの『かなりん』&『まいやん』のとこのフリをやりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"途中でハプニングが..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"片方の靴のヒールが折れてしまいバランスがとれなくなってしまいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ、ビックリしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どーしよー！って、めっちゃパニックでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、一緒に盛り上がってくれてありがとっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして、これなかったかた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ次お会いするときがございますよーに"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その時にきてくれるかな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやはいつでも待ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅかの眼鏡をかりたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ度がきつくて目がいたくなったぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰りのバスは、ひなちまの隣でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして新幹線も"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして、ホテルのお部屋も"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人でずーっと甘栗をたべながらお話ししたよー(;o;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのねーひなちまひどいんよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自撮りと見せかけて......まあやの写真とってきてなぁでも...\n『けしてー！』って言ったら消してくれたんよー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃけぇまあやが自撮りしとる風にして、ひなちまをコッソリ撮ろうとしたら、\n顔隠してこっち見てくれんかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんでちょっとたって消したはずの写真見してきてなぁ(;o;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『なんでー？？？』\nっていったら\n『永久保存したー！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか言ってきてさぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"も〜ひなちま大好きだよ〜?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもその後、又まあやの寝顔写真まで撮られたぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前も撮られた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このやろーーーうっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもまたあそぼうぜっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問\n皆様の住んでる地元の有名な食べ物はなんですか？\nまあやパワー届いてますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/8605967/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye ＼(^o^)／"}],"source":"archive"}